# SWC-DB C++ Conventions

## Files and headers

- Extensions: `.h` / `.cc` (not `.hpp` / `.cpp`)
- PascalCase type files: `AppContext.h`, `CellKey.h`
- Path mirrors namespace: `swcdb/manager/MngdColumns.h` → `SWC::Manager::MngdColumns`
- Guards: `#ifndef swcdb_<module>_<Path>_<Name>_h` — never `#pragma once`
- Project includes: `"swcdb/..."` (quoted). Third-party: `<...>`

## Copyright (required on new source)

```cpp
/*
 * SWC-DB© Copyright since 2019 Alex Kashirin <kashirin.alex@gmail.com>
 * License details at <https://github.com/kashirin-alex/swc-db/#license>
 */
```

## Types and ownership

- Prefer `std::shared_ptr<T>` with `typedef std::shared_ptr<T> Ptr` on the class
- Delete copy ctor/assignment when ownership is shared or move-only
- Nest under `SWC::` matching the directory module
- Match existing style; `-Werror` is on — no new warnings
